@journey name=hl-parity-barnacle-bullets title="Half-Life c1a2 barnacle: the glock hurts the soda room barnacle by the north wall from outside its tongue column (its body was never drawn, so bullets never reached it)" prologue=segment segment_row=18 max_ticks=60000 sync=poll
# Parity journey for docs/parity BN06 (bullets). Retail: a barnacle is an ordinary bullet target (25 health, hull -32..0 under the ceiling). The port cooked its leaf from its origin, inside the ceiling (leaf 0), so the renderer never drew it and an actor that has not been drawn takes no bullet damage. The cook now gives an actor in solid the open leaf inside its hull.
# Route: the parity-barnacle route to w1 (about (2818,-783)), then north-west to about (2760,-660), outside every tongue column, where the barnacle at (2729,-578) (prop slot 0) is in sight; the glock, aimed 24 below its origin (inside its hull), until its health drops (a hit costs it 8). Killing it with bullets is not checked: on the installed disc and this one alike the barnacle hauls the player under it and stays at 1 health under further fire (open, docs/parity BN06). The corridor barnacle (slot 2) is not used: a func_wall panel (model *96, z -300..-284) hangs under its ceiling, so its aim point is inside the panel.
map c1a2 next x
  @wait expr="i32(LOGIC_PLAYER_POS[2]) != 0" timeout=120
  60
  @checkpoint start
  @wait expr="i32(ENT_PHASE[30]) >= 4000" timeout=400
  @face 4000 right
  @hold f127 until y>=-800 timeout=100
  @face 1018 left
